<h2 id="steps-h" class="h2" style="color:#ED217C">Five steps to <br>a new family <br>member</h2>
<p class="lede" style="max-width:520px">We take our time to match every cat with the right home, so nobody is rushed or pressured.</p>
</div>
<ol style="list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0; border-top:1px solid #C4CEDD"><li class="as-row" style="list-style:none"><span class="as-n">1</span><h3>Choose a cat</h3><div><p>Browse our cats and kittens. When someone catches your eye, open their page to read their story.</p><div class="as-act" style="margin-top:14px"><a class="link" href="/cats/">See our cats<svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" ><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></div></div></li><li class="as-row" style="list-style:none"><span class="as-n">2</span><h3>Apply to adopt</h3><div><p>Use the Apply button on the cat's page to fill in our application form, with a little about yourself and the home you could offer. You can ask us a question there too. [We reply within X days.]</p></div></li><li class="as-row" style="list-style:none"><span class="as-n">3</span><h3>Chat with us</h3><div><p>We get to know you and the kind of cat who would be happy in your home. [Confirm: video chats for adopters who live a long way away.]</p></div></li><li class="as-row" style="list-style:none"><span class="as-n">4</span><h3>Home check</h3><div><p>Every adoption is subject to a home check. [Describe what we look at, and whether it is done in person or by video.]</p></div></li><li class="as-row" style="list-style:none"><span class="as-n">5</span><h3>Welcome them home</h3><div><p>Once the home check is approved and the adoption donation is paid, your cat can come home. We stay in touch afterwards, and love to hear how they are settling in. [Confirm what comes with each cat: food, bed, insurance.]</p></div></li></ol></div></section>

